WEBVTT

00:01.750 --> 00:03.000
<b>EMPEROR GODAIGO
</b>

00:03.080 --> 00:07.250
<b>Takauji Ashikaga, the attack on the
Kamakura shogunate was indeed laborious.
</b>

00:07.340 --> 00:10.800
<b>To celebrate your service,
I grant you a character from my real name.
</b>

00:10.880 --> 00:11.880
<b>EXALTED
</b>

00:11.970 --> 00:14.970
<b>From today, you shall write your name
using the kanji for "exalted."
</b>

00:15.050 --> 00:16.800
<b>HEREBY KNOWN AS
TAKAUJI ASHIKAGA
</b>

00:16.890 --> 00:19.010
<b>Thank you. I'm very honored.
</b>

00:19.100 --> 00:20.720
<b>CE 1333 (GENKŌ YEAR 3)
AUGUST 5TH KYOTO
</b>

00:20.810 --> 00:22.930
<b>Thanks to you, I won back the country.
</b>

00:23.020 --> 00:25.770
<b>If there is a position in
the new imperial court that you want,
</b>

00:25.850 --> 00:27.610
<b>do not hesitate to tell me now.
</b>

00:28.110 --> 00:30.230
<b>I am just a soldier.
</b>

00:30.320 --> 00:33.320
<b>I cannot be a scribe.
</b>

00:34.110 --> 00:39.620
<b>However, my retainers behind us
are much too pure of heart
</b>

00:39.700 --> 00:42.500
<b>and exceedingly wise and brave
for the likes of me.
</b>

00:43.290 --> 00:48.340
<b>I would be very happy if you gave
them work in the imperial court.
</b>

00:48.420 --> 00:49.630
<b>Wow.
</b>

00:49.710 --> 00:52.880
<b>I heard he was
the warrior that ruined Kamakura.
</b>

00:52.960 --> 00:55.220
<b>I wonder how demonic his face is.
</b>

00:55.800 --> 00:59.010
<b>He has such a kind smile.
I could just melt!
</b>

00:59.100 --> 01:01.810
<b>He's human after all.
</b>

01:02.560 --> 01:04.850
<b>The Emperor's wish was granted.
</b>

01:05.890 --> 01:08.270
<b>The time has come
for the Emperor and the nobles
</b>

01:08.360 --> 01:12.110
<b>to replace the shogunate's rule
over the country.
</b>

01:12.900 --> 01:15.320
<b>Good work today.
</b>

01:16.360 --> 01:17.700
<b>What is it, Moronao?
</b>

01:18.370 --> 01:19.780
<b>ASHIKAGA HOUSE STEWARD
MORONAO OF KO
</b>

01:19.870 --> 01:21.200
<b>It's nothing.
</b>

01:22.120 --> 01:25.040
<b>I've been serving you
since you were a child.
</b>

01:25.120 --> 01:29.880
<b>But your smile has recently
seemed less and less human.
</b>

01:32.000 --> 01:33.880
<b>Don't say such a stupid thing.
</b>

01:35.090 --> 01:36.090
<b>I'm counting on you.
</b>

01:36.630 --> 01:39.180
<b>We're going to ask everyone
to support the Emperor.
</b>

01:40.970 --> 01:41.970
<b>Sir.
</b>

01:45.020 --> 01:47.730
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI
</b>

03:07.350 --> 03:11.900
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI
</b>

03:15.520 --> 03:17.110
<b>Lord Takauji,
</b>

03:17.190 --> 03:22.110
<b>thank you for recommending me
as governor of Shinano.
</b>

03:22.200 --> 03:24.870
<b>Of course. You deserve the reward.
</b>

03:25.370 --> 03:29.250
<b>You were first to betray the Hojo
and fought as my retainer.
</b>

03:30.330 --> 03:32.040
<b>However, your province, Shinano,
</b>

03:32.120 --> 03:35.630
<b>has Hojo's top retainer,
Mr. Suwa, going strong.
</b>

03:36.210 --> 03:40.470
<b>Hojo's survivors are
definitely taking refuge there.
</b>

03:40.970 --> 03:43.590
<b>I trust you will sniff them out.
</b>

03:45.680 --> 03:46.850
<b>Those ticks.
</b>

03:46.930 --> 03:49.930
<b>I can tell there are four males
and one female.
</b>

03:51.730 --> 03:53.850
<b>Count on me, Lord Takauji.
</b>

03:53.940 --> 03:57.150
<b>My arrows and my eyes are
the most excellent in this country.
</b>

03:57.230 --> 04:01.150
<b>I will find and kill any little bug.
</b>

04:01.240 --> 04:02.240
<b>SADAMUNE OGASAWARA
</b>

04:12.750 --> 04:13.830
<b>SLUGGISH
</b>

04:17.540 --> 04:18.550
<b>Are you serious?
</b>

04:18.630 --> 04:21.340
<b>I've never seen anyone not be able
to cut through a bundle of straw.
</b>

04:22.880 --> 04:24.800
<b>Even on the offense,
</b>

04:24.880 --> 04:29.060
<b>Lord Tokiyuki's muscles are always
getting ready to escape.
</b>

04:29.140 --> 04:32.560
<b>As a result,
he's always timid when he swings.
</b>

04:34.350 --> 04:37.860
<b>You have to train diligently
and put your back into it.
</b>

04:39.150 --> 04:39.980
<b>SQUEEZE SQUEEZE
</b>

04:40.070 --> 04:41.320
<b>That's the opposite of what we want.
</b>

04:41.400 --> 04:42.990
<b>If we train his muscles
to attack too much,
</b>

04:43.070 --> 04:44.780
<b>his running-away muscles will weaken.
</b>

04:44.860 --> 04:48.910
<b>His attack and evasion will become
mediocre, and he'll lose his strong suit.
</b>

04:48.990 --> 04:50.410
<b>What are running-away muscles?
</b>

04:52.450 --> 04:55.330
<b>My lord, you're a good shot.
</b>

04:56.290 --> 04:59.040
<b>My father enjoyed
watching archery competitions.
</b>

05:00.300 --> 05:04.760
<b>Wow, what splendid skill you have,
Lord Tokiyuki!
</b>

05:04.840 --> 05:06.220
<b>Thank you.
</b>

05:06.300 --> 05:08.300
<b>Bulls-eye!
</b>

05:08.390 --> 05:10.720
<b>It's a clean bulls-eye!
</b>

05:10.810 --> 05:14.140
<b>You've done it, Lord Tokiyuki!
</b>

05:14.230 --> 05:18.020
<b>I know I look weak,
but I trained in archery a lot.
</b>

05:18.100 --> 05:19.360
<b>It's decided then.
</b>

05:20.730 --> 05:22.780
<b>Let's maximize your archery skills.
</b>

05:23.360 --> 05:26.650
<b><i>A general who just runs away all the
time is going to weaken his army's morale.
</i></b>

05:26.740 --> 05:28.820
<b><i>We should make the best
of Lord Tokiyuki's special skill.
</i></b>

05:28.910 --> 05:32.620
<b><i>He should learn how to attack
while he runs.
</i></b>

05:32.700 --> 05:36.960
<b><i>I wonder where I could find an instructor
to teach such an unorthodox method?
</i></b>

05:37.040 --> 05:38.210
<b>Lord Yorishige!
</b>

05:38.710 --> 05:43.590
<b>Sadamune Ogasawara of West Shinano
has stopped by for a surprise visit.
</b>

05:44.170 --> 05:45.510
<b>Sadamune?
</b>

05:46.590 --> 05:47.880
<b>Who's that?
</b>

05:48.390 --> 05:50.720
<b>Is he not an acquaintance from Kamakura?
</b>

05:50.800 --> 05:51.970
<b>I don't know him.
</b>

05:52.060 --> 05:53.350
<b>Perhaps he was not of a status
</b>

05:53.430 --> 05:55.850
<b>where he could freely come and go
to my father's residence?
</b>

05:55.930 --> 05:56.940
<b>Okay then.
</b>

05:58.440 --> 06:02.020
<b><i>For good measure,
hide and watch from that small shack.
</i></b>

06:03.780 --> 06:07.320
<b>Oh, Yorishige, it's been too long!
</b>

06:07.400 --> 06:10.370
<b>Thank you for coming all this way.
</b>

06:10.450 --> 06:13.240
<b>What brings you here, Sadamune?
</b>

06:13.830 --> 06:15.540
<b>Sorry for coming so suddenly.
</b>

06:15.620 --> 06:19.080
<b>I just wanted to greet you.
</b>

06:19.170 --> 06:21.580
<b>As you know, the shogunate has fallen.
</b>

06:21.670 --> 06:25.010
<b>The government has
returned to the Emperor Godaigo.
</b>

06:25.090 --> 06:28.050
<b>I have an Imperial Command from him.
</b>

06:28.130 --> 06:30.760
<b>He's appointed me, Sadamune Ogasawara,
as governor of Shinano.
</b>

06:30.840 --> 06:32.350
<b>IMPERIAL COMMAND = DECREE
*DO NOT DEFY
</b>

06:32.430 --> 06:33.970
<b>That is to say,
</b>

06:34.060 --> 06:39.810
<b>you take orders from me now.
</b>

06:39.890 --> 06:40.730
<b><i>Squish.
</i></b>

06:40.810 --> 06:42.400
<b>SUWA FAMILY MEMBER
MORITAKA SUWA
</b>

06:42.480 --> 06:45.280
<b>You were working for Suwa
just the other day.
</b>

06:45.360 --> 06:47.110
<b>Now you want to give us orders?
</b>

06:48.190 --> 06:50.950
<b>When the Kamakura shogunate fell,
</b>

06:51.030 --> 06:55.450
<b>I did a great service to the Emperor
by fighting the rebel Hojo.
</b>

06:55.540 --> 06:58.080
<b>But you… You took Hojo's side.
</b>

06:58.160 --> 07:01.000
<b>Many of you fought on their behalf,
</b>

07:01.080 --> 07:04.880
<b>so you can hardly complain when
your territory gets taken away from you.
</b>

07:04.960 --> 07:08.630
<b>Well, we will visit this issue
another time.
</b>

07:08.720 --> 07:11.340
<b>I came today for one more reason.
</b>

07:14.600 --> 07:19.270
<b>If you have any of the Hojo clan or any of
their important retainers sheltered here,
</b>

07:19.350 --> 07:20.890
<b>hand them over.
</b>

07:23.270 --> 07:25.400
<b>There's no way I'd be hiding someone.
</b>

07:25.480 --> 07:28.280
<b>How can I hand over
someone I haven't even seen?
</b>

07:28.360 --> 07:30.650
<b>Oh, you haven't even seen a Hojo?
</b>

07:33.320 --> 07:35.240
<b><i>In the distance, I can see two soldiers
</i></b>

07:35.330 --> 07:38.660
<b><i>behind the cedar tree
who are watching intently.
</i></b>

07:38.750 --> 07:42.830
<b><i>There's a man who clutches
his small knife, ready for strife.
</i></b>

07:42.920 --> 07:47.630
<b><i>There are children hidden and watching
from a small shack through slits.
</i></b>

07:47.710 --> 07:51.510
<b>They all look like people
suspiciously taking shelter to me!
</b>

07:51.590 --> 07:55.510
<b>You can't fool my all-seeing gaze,
Yorishige.
</b>

07:55.600 --> 07:58.680
<b>I'll catch all of them in no time.
</b>

07:59.600 --> 08:02.390
<b>That's all. I just wanted to say hello.
</b>

08:02.480 --> 08:04.270
<b>Take care.
</b>

08:06.150 --> 08:08.110
<b>Oh, and I forgot to mention.
</b>

08:08.190 --> 08:10.900
<b>I came in a hurry
and didn't bring any gifts.
</b>

08:10.990 --> 08:15.370
<b>Please accept a deer for Suwa Myojin.
</b>

08:15.450 --> 08:16.450
<b>Deer?
</b>

08:26.710 --> 08:30.550
<b>I hear it's good fortune if you catch
a deer with a split ear
</b>

08:30.630 --> 08:33.380
<b>at Suwa Grand Shrine.
</b>

08:36.590 --> 08:37.600
<b>-Sakae!
-Sakae!
</b>

08:38.720 --> 08:44.390
<b>A fortuitous gift for you!
There's one split-eared doe!
</b>

08:47.480 --> 08:48.570
<b>That creep.
</b>

08:52.150 --> 08:53.280
<b>How is Miss Sakae?
</b>

08:53.360 --> 08:55.160
<b>She said it'll sew back together.
</b>

08:55.240 --> 08:59.330
<b>She laughed
and said it wasn't a big deal, but…
</b>

08:59.910 --> 09:03.660
<b>Sadamune Ogasawara is an expert archer
known throughout the country.
</b>

09:03.750 --> 09:07.330
<b><i>His vision and excellent
observational skills give him his edge.
</i></b>

09:08.290 --> 09:11.630
<b>We got a real troublesome one
as the governor of Shinano.
</b>

09:11.710 --> 09:14.420
<b>Damn it. That bug-eyed creep.
</b>

09:14.510 --> 09:17.430
<b>To think he'd aim at a simple
shrine maiden. I can't believe it.
</b>

09:17.510 --> 09:19.100
<b>What do you think, my lord?
</b>

09:20.060 --> 09:22.180
<b>He acts disgracefully as a warrior.
</b>

09:22.720 --> 09:26.140
<b>It's obvious he's a bug-eyed psychopath.
</b>

09:26.640 --> 09:28.940
<b>-But…
-But?
</b>

09:29.650 --> 09:33.110
<b>His archery was beautiful.
</b>

09:36.240 --> 09:39.070
<b><i>What an honest and generous boy.
</i></b>

09:39.160 --> 09:41.620
<b><i>-Even if it's his enemy…
</i>-Of course what he did was not okay.
</b>

09:41.700 --> 09:43.870
<b><i>-…he appreciates skill.
</i>-I don't condone his behavior.
</b>

09:43.950 --> 09:49.080
<b><i>Once he becomes a general,
this fair character will surely be useful.
</i></b>

09:51.040 --> 09:53.510
<b><i>And I just found a perfect instructor.
</i></b>

09:54.880 --> 09:56.550
<b>It's decided, Lord Tokiyuki.
</b>

09:56.630 --> 09:59.840
<b>The next game of tag is hide-and-seek.
</b>

09:59.930 --> 10:01.100
<b>Hide-and-seek?
</b>

10:01.180 --> 10:03.520
<b><i>Sadamune has two goals.
</i></b>

10:03.600 --> 10:05.980
<b><i>First, to find
any surviving Hojo family members.
</i></b>

10:06.060 --> 10:07.640
<b><i>And he'll use that as an excuse to,
</i></b>

10:07.730 --> 10:09.850
<b><i>two, weaken the amount of influence
the Suwa clan has.
</i></b>

10:09.940 --> 10:12.770
<b>You also have two goals.
</b>

10:12.860 --> 10:15.570
<b>First, never let them know who you are.
</b>

10:15.650 --> 10:17.700
<b>Second, absorb his archery technique.
</b>

10:17.780 --> 10:18.990
<b>OGASAWARA TERRITORY
SUWA TERRITORY
</b>

10:19.070 --> 10:20.820
<b><i>Sadamune will abuse
his position as governor,
</i></b>

10:20.910 --> 10:23.450
<b><i>and come to pick fights from now on.
</i></b>

10:23.540 --> 10:24.700
<b>GOVERNOR COMMAND
</b>

10:24.790 --> 10:28.830
<b><i>This means you'll get to see
his archery in action many times.
</i></b>

10:28.920 --> 10:30.790
<b><i>At times, you'll physically hide yourself.
</i></b>

10:30.880 --> 10:32.590
<b><i>Other times, you'll hide your identity.
</i></b>

10:32.670 --> 10:35.420
<b><i>Without being too close or too far,
you'll observe his form.
</i></b>

10:39.470 --> 10:42.890
<b>It's hide-and-seek
from his eyes and arrows!
</b>

10:42.970 --> 10:46.270
<b>The thrill is not knowing
whether you'll be identified or shot!
</b>

10:46.350 --> 10:49.640
<b>Aren't you excited, Lord Tokiyuki?
</b>

10:52.360 --> 10:55.280
<b>I heard a rumor, Mr. Sadamune.
I hear that in three days…
</b>

10:55.360 --> 10:57.150
<b>ASSISTANT TO GOVERNOR OF SHINANO
SUKEFUSA ICHIKAWA
</b>

10:57.240 --> 11:00.240
<b>…we'll get to enjoy a dog-shooting
competition at Suwa Grand Shrine.
</b>

11:00.910 --> 11:03.580
<b>So with that being said,
I have an excellent plan.
</b>

11:03.660 --> 11:06.370
<b>We shall weaken Yorishige Suwa's influence
</b>

11:06.450 --> 11:09.870
<b>and search out the Hojo survivors.
</b>

11:09.960 --> 11:12.330
<b>I'm going to participate in
the dog-shooting competition.
</b>

11:12.420 --> 11:14.590
<b>I'll start a fight and set conditions.
</b>

11:14.670 --> 11:16.800
<b>When I win the competition,
I can get what I want.
</b>

11:16.880 --> 11:19.090
<b>GRIN
</b>

11:19.170 --> 11:20.880
<b>That's a splendid idea.
</b>

11:22.050 --> 11:25.430
<b><i>That felt so gross to have him
whisper to me with those protruding eyes!
</i></b>

11:27.020 --> 11:31.770
<b>DAY OF DOG-SHOOTING COMPETITION
</b>

11:34.110 --> 11:37.030
<b>Damn it. I can't hit anything!
</b>

11:37.110 --> 11:39.150
<b>I have to get better.
</b>

11:42.700 --> 11:44.740
<b>Lord Tokiyuki, you're next.
</b>

11:44.820 --> 11:46.490
<b>Good luck.
</b>

11:46.580 --> 11:47.410
<b>Thank you.
</b>

11:47.490 --> 11:52.870
<b>Shizuku, it's dangerous to say
Lord Tokiyuki's name in this crowd.
</b>

11:52.960 --> 11:56.500
<b>From now on, use a false name.
</b>

11:56.590 --> 11:59.010
<b>Think of a pseudonym.
</b>

11:59.710 --> 12:01.930
<b>Then I'll call you Big Brother.
</b>

12:05.640 --> 12:06.720
<b>What?
</b>

12:08.810 --> 12:09.850
<b>My lord!
</b>

12:09.930 --> 12:11.480
<b>You have to see this!
</b>

12:11.560 --> 12:12.810
<b>We have a surprise contestant!
</b>

12:12.890 --> 12:15.190
<b>The governor of Shinano,
Sadamune Ogasawara,
</b>

12:15.270 --> 12:16.900
<b>is jumping into the competition!
</b>

12:17.520 --> 12:20.440
<b>Why is he acting like he can just join in?
</b>

12:20.530 --> 12:22.110
<b>And so persistently…
</b>

12:22.200 --> 12:26.200
<b>Dog-shooting competitions
are Shinano's main event.
</b>

12:26.280 --> 12:29.490
<b>As the governor of Shinano,
I had to liven up the party.
</b>

12:29.580 --> 12:32.210
<b>Am I allowed, Yorishige?
</b>

12:32.790 --> 12:35.080
<b>Of course. I welcome you.
</b>

12:35.170 --> 12:36.840
<b>You have five arrows.
</b>

12:36.920 --> 12:41.340
<b>Scoring is based on the location
of the shot and shooting posture as usual.
</b>

12:42.340 --> 12:43.380
<b>Release the dogs!
</b>

12:53.520 --> 12:55.810
<b>Right-handed shot on the dog's stomach.
Four points!
</b>

12:57.230 --> 12:59.570
<b>Right-handed shot on the dog's head.
Five points!
</b>

13:03.070 --> 13:05.410
<b>Right-handed shot on the dog's neck.
Five points!
</b>

13:05.490 --> 13:07.240
<b><i>What skill.
</i></b>

13:07.320 --> 13:10.370
<b><i>He's shooting all right-handed shots
that score high points.
</i></b>

13:10.450 --> 13:11.290
<b>LEFT SIDED
</b>

13:11.370 --> 13:13.120
<b><i>With the right-handed shot,
it's hard to pull the bow
</i></b>

13:13.200 --> 13:14.210
<b><i>when you must twist your body.
</i></b>

13:14.290 --> 13:15.120
<b>RIGHT SIDED
</b>

13:15.210 --> 13:16.040
<b><i>And what's more,
</i></b>

13:16.120 --> 13:18.880
<b><i>he's hitting the dogs all on their
critical points, on their upper half.
</i></b>

13:19.880 --> 13:22.840
<b><i>Mr. Yorishige is quivering?
</i></b>

13:22.920 --> 13:25.180
<b><i>Is he terrified of Sadamune's skills?
</i></b>

13:25.260 --> 13:26.090
<b>SHAKE SHAKE SHAKE
</b>

13:26.180 --> 13:29.100
<b>It's not that. In the future,
they consider this animal abuse.
</b>

13:29.180 --> 13:31.390
<b>But during this time,
this is a normal thing.
</b>

13:31.470 --> 13:33.350
<b>If this is a problem, I'm in trouble.
</b>

13:33.430 --> 13:35.810
<b>Who in the world are you justifying to?
</b>

13:38.020 --> 13:41.230
<b>Now let's see, what place am I now?
</b>

13:41.320 --> 13:43.570
<b>Individually, you're in first.
</b>

13:43.650 --> 13:45.030
<b>Oh?
</b>

13:45.110 --> 13:49.450
<b>Are you shocked that
a surprise contestant has first place?
</b>

13:49.530 --> 13:53.700
<b>So is this the level
of Suwa Grand Shrine to the God of War?
</b>

13:53.790 --> 13:55.210
<b>Don't get cocky!
</b>

13:55.290 --> 13:57.250
<b>There are still
many strong competitors waiting!
</b>

13:58.540 --> 14:02.250
<b>Then let those strong competitors
come bet on a one-on-one match.
</b>

14:02.340 --> 14:03.340
<b>A bet?
</b>

14:03.420 --> 14:07.130
<b>As you know,
I'm looking for Hojo survivors.
</b>

14:07.220 --> 14:11.140
<b>If none of you can win against me,
</b>

14:11.220 --> 14:15.230
<b><i>you'll allow me to search
</i></b>

14:15.310 --> 14:20.110
<b><i>your suspicious folks' homes for them
without complaint.
</i></b>

14:20.190 --> 14:23.070
<b>That scumbag,
saying whatever conditions he wants.
</b>

14:23.150 --> 14:26.190
<b>He only has a few men, but he's so bold.
</b>

14:26.280 --> 14:31.700
<b>We can't oppose him too carelessly
since he was appointed by the Emperor.
</b>

14:31.780 --> 14:33.370
<b>On the other hand,
</b>

14:33.450 --> 14:36.870
<b>if he comes out and says what he wants,
he won't get off scot-free.
</b>

14:38.210 --> 14:43.800
<b>This is how Sadamune and I advance
and retreat in our fight without a fight.
</b>

14:45.420 --> 14:47.420
<b>I'm in on that bet.
</b>

14:48.510 --> 14:54.720
<b>If we win, then with your authority,
you won't let our territory be searched.
</b>

14:54.810 --> 14:56.430
<b>How's that?
</b>

14:57.770 --> 14:59.310
<b><i>You bit the bait.
</i></b>

14:59.390 --> 15:02.400
<b><i>As a Suwa landlord, you have your pride.
</i></b>

15:02.480 --> 15:05.980
<b><i>If you're challenged
in front of your people, you must accept.
</i></b>

15:06.070 --> 15:07.940
<b><i>Lose the bet and suffer embarrassment!
</i></b>

15:08.030 --> 15:11.660
<b><i>Afterwards, if we can find the Hojo
refugees, we'll expose your crimes!
</i></b>

15:11.740 --> 15:14.620
<b><i>Suwa will fall, and you will
have to surrender to Ogasawara.
</i></b>

15:14.700 --> 15:15.910
<b>HOJO
</b>

15:17.200 --> 15:20.870
<b>And what strong competitor will you offer?
</b>

15:20.960 --> 15:22.380
<b>Strong competitor?
</b>

15:22.460 --> 15:26.050
<b>For you, I think this child is sufficient.
</b>

15:27.380 --> 15:28.720
<b>Pop!
</b>

15:28.800 --> 15:30.880
<b>His name is Chojumaru.
</b>

15:30.970 --> 15:34.350
<b>He's Suwa's least competent,
so I think it'll be a good match.
</b>

15:34.430 --> 15:38.520
<b>Are you mocking me, Yorishige?
</b>

15:38.600 --> 15:43.480
<b>It's not interesting
if we do things the normal way.
</b>

15:43.560 --> 15:49.440
<b>So let's make a rule that you can also win
points by shooting at each other's bodies.
</b>

15:50.240 --> 15:53.450
<b>Huh? Are you shaking in your boots?
</b>

15:53.530 --> 15:57.790
<b>Unlike the shrine maiden you shot
the other day, this boy's got a weapon!
</b>

15:57.870 --> 15:59.580
<b>Stop this, Lord Yorishige!
</b>

15:59.660 --> 16:03.120
<b>The young lord's combat prowess
is that of a rabbit. Suwa will end!
</b>

16:03.210 --> 16:05.790
<b>He's someone whose face goes "sigh"
and loses.
</b>

16:05.880 --> 16:08.300
<b>Don't underestimate his weakness!
</b>

16:08.380 --> 16:09.420
<b>What they said!
</b>

16:09.510 --> 16:12.050
<b>I don't understand why you're purposely
</b>

16:12.130 --> 16:15.050
<b>making the chased battle
against the chaser.
</b>

16:16.140 --> 16:18.220
<b>There's great worth in it.
</b>

16:18.310 --> 16:22.690
<b>Battling against a master
will let you grow greatly.
</b>

16:22.770 --> 16:28.070
<b>Lord Tokiyuki, I can see
a bright future full of growth for you
</b>

16:28.150 --> 16:29.980
<b>if you go against him.
</b>

16:30.070 --> 16:31.860
<b>I will say this clearly.
</b>

16:31.950 --> 16:35.700
<b>After the battle,
you will learn a cool new skill.
</b>

16:36.280 --> 16:37.870
<b>At least, that's a feeling I get.
</b>

16:37.950 --> 16:39.450
<b>I wonder if it'll happen?
</b>

16:40.040 --> 16:41.410
<b>Speak clearly!
</b>

16:42.210 --> 16:45.170
<b>Now, what shall we do today?
</b>

16:45.250 --> 16:48.670
<b>As general of Hojo, you can
choose danger and grow, or run away.
</b>

16:49.250 --> 16:51.300
<b>It's up to you.
</b>

16:53.340 --> 16:55.090
<b>That's an unfair way to put it.
</b>

16:55.180 --> 16:58.850
<b>You're always making me do what you want.
</b>

16:58.930 --> 17:02.350
<b><i>If I've decided to kill Takauji, then…
</i></b>

17:03.480 --> 17:05.600
<b>Give me the arrows, Shizuku.
</b>

17:07.400 --> 17:08.980
<b>What a strange person.
</b>

17:09.070 --> 17:11.480
<b>He's always running away,
</b>

17:11.570 --> 17:14.280
<b>but he doesn't run away
from the most formidable enemy here.
</b>

17:14.990 --> 17:17.780
<b>I see his future clearly now too.
</b>

17:17.870 --> 17:24.870
<b>He won't run away from the
important things he's set his heart on.
</b>

17:27.830 --> 17:33.760
<b>Kid, I'll make you pay
the price for disrespecting me.
</b>

17:33.840 --> 17:36.590
<b>Please send the bill to Mr. Yorishige.
</b>

17:36.680 --> 17:39.550
<b>I can tell you're unskilled
by just looking at you.
</b>

17:39.640 --> 17:41.850
<b>You really think you can win, kid?
</b>

17:41.930 --> 17:45.230
<b>Only God knows.
</b>

17:46.480 --> 17:47.650
<b>Begin!
</b>

17:50.570 --> 17:54.990
<b><i>Right, should I gain points
by hitting dogs per usual?
</i></b>

17:55.570 --> 17:57.740
<b><i>Of course not! The kid is my target!
</i></b>

17:59.370 --> 18:00.620
<b>Damn kid!
</b>

18:00.700 --> 18:03.160
<b>You really wish to anger me?
</b>

18:03.240 --> 18:05.120
<b><i>It doesn't have to land.
</i></b>

18:05.210 --> 18:09.380
<b><i>Make him completely focus on you
as the target with your first blow.
</i></b>

18:09.960 --> 18:13.630
<b><i>A warrior is a creature that
can't turn down a challenge.
</i></b>

18:13.710 --> 18:16.550
<b><i>He will, without a doubt, shoot back.
</i></b>

18:16.630 --> 18:18.550
<b><i>First, dodge his shots.
</i></b>

18:22.100 --> 18:25.640
<b><i>Sadamune doesn't like to
shoot in rapid succession
</i></b>

18:26.140 --> 18:28.520
<b><i>because he gives his all for every shot.
</i></b>

18:29.440 --> 18:31.940
<b><i>You'll have time
till he shoots the next arrow.
</i></b>

18:32.020 --> 18:34.860
<b><i>Till then,
shoot a dog and gain some points.
</i></b>

18:35.490 --> 18:39.280
<b><i>There should be a red dog that runs
close by so as to be an easy target.
</i></b>

18:40.620 --> 18:43.660
<b>That dog was trained
for entertainment purposes!
</b>

18:43.740 --> 18:45.330
<b>There's such a thing?
</b>

18:48.960 --> 18:51.080
<b><i>Make sure you aim, you lousy shooter!
</i></b>

18:51.170 --> 18:53.090
<b><i>I only get my venison reward
if you hit me.
</i></b>

18:53.170 --> 18:54.460
<b>One more shot!
</b>

18:56.840 --> 18:57.760
<b><i>That's it.
</i></b>

18:57.840 --> 19:00.090
<b>Left-handed shot on the torso. One point!
</b>

19:00.180 --> 19:01.930
<b>The brat got the first point!
</b>

19:02.010 --> 19:04.010
<b>Damn kid!
</b>

19:04.100 --> 19:06.270
<b><i>Afterwards, simply focus on evading.
</i></b>

19:06.350 --> 19:10.060
<b><i>For someone that doesn't know you,
it'll be difficult to hit you.
</i></b>

19:12.560 --> 19:14.230
<b>TOP MAJOR LEAGUER'S BEST SPEED
ABOUT 160 KM/H
</b>

19:16.280 --> 19:17.940
<b>THIRD KEISEI SKYLINER TOP SPEED
QUICKEST 36 MIN.
</b>

19:18.030 --> 19:19.360
<b>ARROWS WERE SLOWER
THAN MODERN ARROWS.
</b>

19:19.450 --> 19:20.820
<b>DODGING THEM WAS NOT UNHEARD OF.
</b>

19:23.620 --> 19:25.990
<b><i>Dang. This is my last arrow.
</i></b>

19:26.490 --> 19:28.250
<b><i>I still don't have any points.
</i></b>

19:28.330 --> 19:30.620
<b><i>If I miss, that seals my loss.
</i></b>

19:31.210 --> 19:35.130
<b><i>Sadamune is feeling the pressure now.
Will he readjust his aim toward the dogs?
</i></b>

19:35.210 --> 19:38.590
<b><i>The dogs chosen for this event are
Suwa Grand Shrine's best runners.
</i></b>

19:40.300 --> 19:43.640
<b><i>Not even Sadamune can hit you so easily.
</i></b>

19:44.640 --> 19:47.470
<b><i>Using your skilled evasion
to your advantage,
</i></b>

19:47.560 --> 19:49.270
<b><i>aim for Sadamune
with your remaining arrows.
</i></b>

19:49.350 --> 19:52.900
<b><i>Once he fears being your target,
he'll become frustrated and confused.
</i></b>

19:52.980 --> 19:57.230
<b><i>Having lost all composure,
he won't even be able to aim at the dogs.
</i></b>

20:02.160 --> 20:04.410
<b>This is bad.
Sadamune is in Lord Tokiyuki's blind spot.
</b>

20:05.080 --> 20:08.790
<b>It's impossible for the lord to aim
no matter how he twists or turns.
</b>

20:08.870 --> 20:11.620
<b>To win a war,
simply having a bow and arrow won't do.
</b>

20:11.710 --> 20:14.630
<b>You must be on horseback in order to
gain an indispensable vantage point.
</b>

20:14.710 --> 20:17.130
<b>This isn't
a dog-shooting competition anymore.
</b>

20:17.210 --> 20:19.420
<b>It's an equestrian archery showdown
you'd see on the battlefield.
</b>

20:19.510 --> 20:21.010
<b>Lord Moritaka.
</b>

20:21.510 --> 20:23.550
<b>Suwa Grand Shrine's king of commentary.
</b>

20:24.390 --> 20:27.100
<b>Chojumaru continuously attempts to
throw Sadamune out of his blind spot
</b>

20:27.180 --> 20:28.930
<b>by frantically turning his horse.
</b>

20:29.020 --> 20:32.310
<b>Without even holding on to the reins,
Sadamune trails him easily.
</b>

20:33.560 --> 20:39.230
<b><i>Even Emperor Godaigo praised
Sadamune Ogasawara's martial arts.
</i></b>

20:40.570 --> 20:41.610
<b>It's good.
</b>

20:41.700 --> 20:43.570
<b>The Emperor said "It's good!"
</b>

20:43.660 --> 20:44.490
<b>KING
</b>

20:44.570 --> 20:47.080
<b><i>"Sadamune should be
an example for all warriors."
</i></b>

20:47.160 --> 20:49.700
<b><i>Thus, Ogasawara was granted special
permission from the Emperor himself
</i></b>

20:49.790 --> 20:52.460
<b><i>to use the character "king"
in his family crest.
</i></b>

20:53.120 --> 20:56.420
<b><i>Sadamune's discipline of martial arts
</i></b>

20:56.500 --> 21:00.090
<b><i>is still widely practiced to this day,
in the 21st century.
</i></b>

21:00.170 --> 21:05.680
<b><i>With your focus so divided
between steering your horse and dodging,
</i></b>

21:05.760 --> 21:09.350
<b><i>don't think that split second where
you forget to evade will escape my gaze!
</i></b>

21:11.980 --> 21:13.890
<b>NANBOKUCHO GAME OF TAG
ALL-SEEING DEMON OGASAWARA
</b>

21:19.110 --> 21:20.900
<b>Right-handed shot on the opponent's head.
Five points!
</b>

21:20.980 --> 21:22.650
<b>Whoa, what a comeback!
</b>

21:22.740 --> 21:25.820
<b>That Sadamune didn't hold back!
He's winning by four points!
</b>

21:26.570 --> 21:29.120
<b>Now, I've exhausted all my arrows.
</b>

21:29.200 --> 21:32.000
<b>You're free to aim for whatever you like.
Dog or human.
</b>

21:32.080 --> 21:35.170
<b>I won't give up my position
in your blind spot though.
</b>

21:35.250 --> 21:39.500
<b>I'll run my horse into you to
hinder your shot when you aim for a dog.
</b>

21:39.590 --> 21:41.500
<b>The game is over, kid.
</b>

21:43.550 --> 21:46.090
<b><i>There's blood. It hurts.
</i></b>

21:46.180 --> 21:48.470
<b><i>There's no winning. I'm scared!
</i></b>

21:48.550 --> 21:50.970
<b><i>If this was a real arrow, I'd be dead.
</i></b>

21:55.310 --> 21:57.150
<b><i>Why do you run?
</i></b>

21:57.230 --> 21:58.690
<b><i>Are you afraid?
</i></b>

21:59.270 --> 22:00.730
<b><i>Are you uselessly struggling?
</i></b>

22:03.030 --> 22:04.280
<b><i>This is fun!
</i></b>

23:33.660 --> 23:35.660
<b>Translated by Emily Walton
</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b>EPISODE 5 (YEAR OF 1333): SETTLING THE SCORE!
</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b>A DOG-SHOOTING COMPETITION AND THEN...
</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b>
</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b>
</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b>
</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b>
</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b>
</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b>
</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b>
</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b>
</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b>
</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b><i>Let's go!
</i></b>
